ation? We can post stories about each other’s account and promote each other? Could be useful to boost follower for both of us. Let me know your thoughts!"}]}, {"participants": ["mary.merry_", "data_iceberg"], "conversation": [{"sender": "data_iceberg", "created_at": "2020-11-02T16:13:16.118463+00:00", "text": "And you can see from my posts, I base in London :)"}, {"sender": "data_iceberg", "created_at": "2020-11-02T16:12:55.530685+00:00", "text": "Hahaha, I like that you piece together the information and deduct my status, you probably make a good detective. For most of the geographical post, I tried to be more random and less developed country centric. But it is kinda hard to be completely random, I realise there is some many knowledge gaps for what I know. Creating these post really helped me learn as well."}, {"sender": "mary.merry_", "created_at": "2020-11-02T11:01:52.164710+00:00", "text": "Ohhhhh you live in the UK, I shouldn't have assumed the USA 😅"}, {"sender": "mary.merry_", "created_at": "2020-11-02T10:59:09.963863+00:00", "text": "Jk jk jk and no offense if you're Russian bc I have dear friends from Russia"}, {"sender": "mary.merry_", "created_at": "2020-11-02T10:58:20.572291+00:00", "text": "Or maybe you are trumpy bc you're promoting Russia here"}, {"sender": "mary.merry_", "created_at": "2020-11-02T10:55:51.490562+00:00", "text": "You're obv not a grumpy trumpy trump chump"}, {"sender": "mary.merry_", "created_at": "2020-11-02T10:53:17.053183+00:00", "text": "Your last* expired story quiz"}, {"sender": "mary.merry_", "created_at": "2020-11-02T10:50:34.364867+00:00", "text": "I started following your about 2 weeks ago so I'm going to peruse your charts so I can answer your story quiz"}, {"sender": "mary.merry_", "created_at": "2020-11-02T10:49:25.276901+00:00", "text": "Early bird 🐦 I've seen females too, suuuuper impressive too"}, {"sender": "data_iceberg", "created_at": "2020-11-02T09:37:21.805775+00:00", "text": "Thanks! I actually saw quite a few infographics account ran by women, so I can see that this is not a purely male dominated space!"}, {"sender": "mary.merry_", "created_at": "2020-10-31T21:23:41.093865+00:00", "text": "Anddd maybe I guessed female to break the stereotype of math = male"}, {"sender": "mary.merry_", "created_at": "2020-10-31T20:37:17.834418+00:00", "text": "I appreciate the broad range of topics! They seem super creative and fun"}, {"sender": "mary.merry_", "created_at": "2020-10-31T20:35:00.582838+00:00", "text": "😅😅 Idk why I acted confident, I only guessed female bc you agreed that the joker seems broken"}, {"sender": "data_iceberg", "created_at": "2020-10-31T20:24:09.653534+00:00", "text": "Haha, I’m actually surprised, I deliberately tried to explore a board range of topics to avoid being too focused on a specific audience group. But I’m actually a guy haha"}, {"sender": "data_iceberg", "created_at": "2020-10-31T20:23:03.606548+00:00", "text": "Thanks anything you would like to see I will consider it :)"}, {"sender": "mary.merry_", "created_at": "2020-10-31T17:22:31.215373+00:00", "text": "Hahaha now I wonder if you're male or female bc it isn't obvious here and I'm assuming female 🕵🏻‍♀️ it's a rhetorical wonder though"}, {"sender": "mary.merry_", "created_at": "2020-10-31T17:18:53.426695+00:00", "text": "I intended to reply to you Oct 25th too. It's really fun and inspiring that you create a post each day, so I'll definitely let you know if I have any ideas!"}, {"sender": "data_iceberg", "created_at": "2020-10-31T15:35:14.544181+00:00", "text": "I can see why girls like the joker less, the guy is broken. Jk not sexist neither 😝"}, {"sender": "mary.merry_", "created_at": "2020-10-31T15:28:20.831696+00:00", "text": "Jk jk jk, I'm not sexist like that"}, {"sender": "mary.merry_", "created_at": "2020-10-31T15:28:07.018933+00:00", "text": "Haha yikes. Maybe it'll be good vs evil, girls vs guys"}, {"sender": "data_iceberg", "created_at": "2020-10-31T14:44:35.077863+00:00", "text": "Actually 4 guys voted for the joker before anyone voted for Batman. Interesting"}, {"sender": "mary.merry_", "created_at": "2020-10-31T14:41:46.827578+00:00", "story_share": "Shared data_iceberg's story", "text": "Whoa, who's the evil responder(s) in the first 6 minutes? Is it youuu yourself?"}, {"sender": "data_iceberg", "created_at": "2020-10-25T09:45:09.471035+00:00", "text": "Also if you have any request/ suggestion, feel free to just shoot me a message :)"}, {"sender": "data_iceberg", "created_at": "2020-10-25T09:44:44.356716+00:00", "text": "Thanks for your support! This really means a lot to me!"}, {"sender": "mary.merry_", "created_at": "2020-10-25T00:39:00.913970+00:00", "likes": [{"username": "data_iceberg", "date": "2020-10-25T09:44:43.511311+00:00"}], "text": "I reallyyyy like your page! Thank you for the fun data 🤓"}, {"sender": "mary.merry_", "created_at": "2020-10-25T00:38:37.006317+00:00", "text": "Ohhhhh I assumed food, but I wondered about social media, media, toxic friends or habits"}, {"sender": "data_iceberg", "created_at": "2020-10-24T23:27:58.969873+00:00", "text": "Hey thanks for your message. I was referring to detoxing by food, not drug detox"}, {"sender": "mary.merry_", "created_at": "2020-10-24T14:12:51.028521+00:00", "story_share": "Shared data_iceberg's story", "text": "What kinda detox?"}]}, {"participants": ["datavizsociety", "data_iceberg"], "conversation": [{"sender": "data_iceberg", "created_at": "2020-10-30T08:59:01.671439+00:00", "text": "Hey! Thanks for liking my post. The post is an original, I’m happy for you to use it, but please do credit my account and not cover up the logo at the bottom left. Otherwise happy for you to use my content :)"}]}, {"participants": ["jackarak", "data_iceberg"], "conversation": [{"sender": "jackarak", "created_at": "2020-10-06T18:33:20.039192+00:00", "text": "Of course!"}, {"sender": "data_iceberg", "created_at": "2020-10-06T13:36:36.368419+00:00", "text": "No worries! It is actually very encouraging for me that someone  actually messages me to ask me about my content. Really appreciated!"}, {"sender": "jackarak", "created_at": "2020-10-06T13:24:01.240988+00:00", "text": "Ah dudes thank you for taking my presumptuous malcorrection so well!! My bad. I now feel a little embarrassed, but don’t worry I’ll be fine lol. As you were, and thank you for the content."}, {"sender": "data_iceberg", "created_at": "2020-10-06T13:02:43.808834+00:00", "text": "Hey Jack, thanks for the support and the heads up! The numbers sum up to 51 because District of Columbia is counted separately. It is specified in the footnote."}, {"sender": "jackarak", "created_at": "2020-10-06T12:28:59.505084+00:00", "text": "Love this page though!!"}, {"sender": "jackarak", "created_at": "2020-10-06T12:28:51.115341+00:00", "text": "Your math isn’t correct."}]}, {"participants": ["nedych2018", "data_iceberg"], "conversation": [{"sender": "data_iceberg", "created_at": "2020-10-02T11:05:11.478564+00:00", "text": "Think you may like this account"}, {"sender": "data_iceberg", "created_at": "2020-10-02T11:04:59.800626+00:00", "story_share": "Shared explainerhk's story", "text": "", "story_share_type": "default"}, {"sender": "nedych2018", "created_at": "2020-08-24T22:27:16.061174+00:00", "text": "Lol"}, {"sender": "data_iceberg", "created_at": "2020-08-24T22:26:49.460077+00:00", "text": "But*"}, {"sender": "data_iceberg", "created_at": "2020-08-24T22:26:44.476173+00:00", "text": "No anyways I actually just like it’s graphics"}, {"sender": "data_iceberg", "created_at": "2020-08-24T22:26:24.648704+00:00", "text": "It is a bit like our fur elise post no?"}, {"sender": "nedych2018", "created_at": "2020-08-24T22:25:48.631031+00:00", "text": "Yau d pointless lol"}, {"sender": "data_iceberg", "created_at": "2020-08-24T22:18:57.192605+00:00", "text": "Just some interesting things to count"}, {"sender": "nedych2018", "created_at": "2020-08-24T22:18:36.510618+00:00", "text": "?"}, {"sender": "data_iceberg", "created_at": "2020-08-24T22:17:05.123645+00:00", "media_owner": "barelymaps", "media_share_caption": "The number of ‘whale’ words on every page of Moby-Dick.\n.\nExtracts: “This mere painstaking burrower and grub-worm of a poor devil of a Sub-Sub appears to have gone through the long Vatican and street-stalls of the earth, picking up whatever random allusion to whales he could anyways find.”\n.\n#mobydick #whale #whales #whaler #whalers #whaleman #whalemans #whalemen #whalemens #whalebone #whalin #whaling #dataviz", "media_share_url": "Media share unavailable."}]}, {"participants": ["datastuffplus", "data_iceberg"], "conversation": [{"sender": "data_iceberg", "created_at": "2020-09-17T12:47:10.652673+00:00", "likes": [{"username": "datastuffplus", "date": "2020-09-17T13:01:55.372152+00:00"}], "story_share": "Shared datastuffplus's story", "text": "😂"}, {"sender": "datastuffplus", "created_at": "2020-09-17T12:40:21.702839+00:00", "mentioned_username": "data_iceberg", "story_share": "Shared datastuffplus's story", "text": null}, {"sender": "data_iceberg", "created_at": "2020-09-14T14:19:50.052680+00:00", "likes": [{"username": "datastuffplus", "date": "2020-09-14T14:20:00.195616+00:00"}], "text": "No worries:)"}, {"sender": "datastuffplus", "created_at": "2020-09-14T14:19:40.135631+00:00", "text": "Oh man awesome!! Thanks!"}, {"sender": "data_iceberg", "created_at": "2020-09-14T14:19:13.491830+00:00", "text": "So you can zoom in"}, {"sender": "data_iceberg", "created_at": "2020-09-14T14:19:10.139964+00:00", "text": "Here’s an uncompressed version"}, {"sender": "data_iceberg", "created_at": "2020-09-14T14:19:04.998306+00:00", "likes": [{"username": "datastuffplus", "date": "2020-09-14T14:19:45.763428+00:00"}], "media": "https://scontent-atl3-2.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.2885-15/e35/119211835_2640659662930199_479370124539686702_n.jpg?_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=111&_nc_ohc=3Xk1_SOkKUEAX8dmJXH&tp=18&oh=a2aa320d5d0416ebc3f6beec31e59e6b&oe=5FD07F4B&ig_cache_key=MjM5ODA3NzU2OTEwNzc5NDI3OA%3D%3D.2"}, {"sender": "datastuffplus", "created_at": "2020-09-13T18:40:28.164367+00:00", "text": "Good"}, {"sender": "datastuffplus", "created_at": "2020-09-13T18:40:26.660579+00:00", "text": "So really any higher res is gokd"}, {"sender": "datastuffplus", "created_at": "2020-09-13T18:40:19.972247+00:00", "text": "I think she just wanted to see the numbers etc bigger. Not really for prints."}, {"sender": "data_iceberg", "created_at": "2020-09-13T18:39:54.801197+00:00", "text": "What does she need to use it for if you don’t mind me asking"}, {"sender": "data_iceberg", "created_at": "2020-09-13T18:39:22.415371+00:00", "text": "I don’t mind sharing tbh, how big she needs it to be? I want to see if the resolution is high enough."}, {"sender": "datastuffplus", "created_at": "2020-09-13T18:24:15.681106+00:00", "text": "Do you sell prints of it?"}, {"sender": "datastuffplus", "created_at": "2020-09-13T18:24:08.174524+00:00", "text": "My sister in law liked it and wondered if there is a bigger version"}, {"sender": "data_iceberg", "created_at": "2020-09-13T18:19:57.879628+00:00", "text": "Why?"}, {"sender": "data_iceberg", "created_at": "2020-09-13T18:19:49.083546+00:00", "text": "Hey yes that one I created it myself"}, {"sender": "datastuffplus", "created_at": "2020-09-13T17:54:42.829156+00:00", "text": "Hey!  You created the monopoly chart right?"}, {"sender": "datastuffplus", "created_at": "2020-09-12T17:58:19.137321+00:00", "text": "Will do!"}, {"sender": "data_iceberg", "created_at": "2020-09-12T17:53:27.108483+00:00", "likes": [{"username": "datastuffplus", "date": "2020-09-12T17:58:16.412958+00:00"}], "text": "Cool, keep it on. And also let me know how your monetisation plan go, I am genuinely curious. Good luck!"}, {"sender": "datastuffplus", "created_at": "2020-09-12T17:52:21.960254+00:00", "text": "Coolio. Keep crushing it!!"}, {"sender": "datastuffplus", "created_at": "2020-09-12T17:51:23.016411+00:00", "text": "Ya no names"}, {"sender": "datastuffplus", "created_at": "2020-09-12T17:51:19.001151+00:00", "text": "Perfect thanks a bunch!"}, {"sender": "data_iceberg", "created_at": "2020-09-12T17:49:29.202796+00:00", "likes": [{"username": "datastuffplus", "date": "2020-09-12T17:51:24.750468+00:00"}], "text": "I prefer not to be named, but feel free to use this stats"}, {"sender": "datastuffplus", "created_at": "2020-09-12T17:48:51.108991+00:00", "text": "Would it be ok to post these stats on my website as a case study??"}, {"sender": "datastuffplus", "created_at": "2020-09-12T17:48:35.056735+00:00", "text": "Man this is super helpful!"}, {"sender": "data_iceberg", "created_at": "2020-09-12T17:47:08.671236+00:00", "text": "Hope this info is helpful"}, {"sender": "data_iceberg", "created_at": "2020-09-12T17:47:02.148221+00:00", "text": "So I think total user from the 3 post + 2 stories + featured account for the last 2 weeks took me from 150 => 600 today. For simplicity sake, I will attribute all of them to the campaign, so 450 increase. In terms of efficiency, I think it goes story => post => featured account"}, {"sender": "data_iceberg", "created_at": "2020-09-12T17:44:39.092477+00:00", "likes": [{"username": "datastuffplus", "date": "2020-09-12T17:44:49.143676+00:00"}], "text": "Cool, thanks for the help, it was definitely great impact."}, {"sender": "datastuffplus", "created_at": "2020-09-12T13:33:07.365351+00:00", "text": "Do you have a rough idea of how many total follows you think you got from the capaign?"}, {"sender": "datastuffplus", "created_at": "2020-09-12T13:32:41.523930+00:00", "text": "Today in gojng to take you down as the featured account. Hope it helped!"}, {"sender": "datastuffplus", "created_at": "2020-09-09T16:45:37.842259+00:00", "likes": [{"username": "data_iceberg", "date": "2020-09-09T17:31:02.993585+00:00"}], "text": "Niceeee!  Glad to hear it!"}, {"sender": "data_iceberg", "created_at": "2020-09-09T16:36:43.818307+00:00", "text": "Hey, I think since yesterday’s story, I saw around +80 followers, from 380 to 460 in about 24 hours. I would say the impact is rather significant"}, {"sender": "datastuffplus", "created_at": "2020-09-09T14:48:52.884990+00:00", "text": "Howdy!  I wanted to check in to see how many follows you think were attributed to the featured and post etc"}, {"sender": "data_iceberg", "created_at": "2020-09-08T16:18:59.933802+00:00", "likes": [{"username": "datastuffplus", "date": "2020-09-08T16:44:40.442329+00:00"}], "mentioned_username": "datastuffplus", "story_share": "Shared data_iceberg's story", "text": null}, {"sender": "data_iceberg", "created_at": "2020-09-08T16:13:37.983800+00:00", "mentioned_username": "datastuffplus", "story_share": "Shared data_iceberg's story", "text": null}, {"sender": "datastuffplus", "created_at": "2020-09-08T15:40:16.333831+00:00", "likes": [{"username": "datastuffplus", "date": "2020-09-08T16:18:10.156381+00:00"}], "mentioned_username": "data_iceberg", "story_share": "Shared datastuffplus's story", "text": null}, {"sender": "data_iceberg", "created_at": "2020-09-08T09:29:12.156889+00:00", "likes": [{"username": "datastuffplus", "date": "2020-09-12T17:46:15.049461+00:00"}], "text": "Ok, interesting, would be interesting to see how you can leverage your reach to monetize! Good luck. I will let you know the result, so far it’s been great for an account of my scale."}, {"sender": "datastuffplus", "created_at": "2020-09-07T23:35:12.021108+00:00", "likes": [{"username": "data_iceberg", "date": "2020-09-08T09:28:04.533060+00:00"}], "text": ".basically if at the end of the week you could let me know how impactful it was for your page it would be a great help!"}, {"sender": "datastuffplus", "created_at": "2020-09-07T22:27:47.655365+00:00", "text": "But I have no idea how effective it is so yours is sort of a test"}, {"sender": "datastuffplus", "created_at": "2020-09-07T22:27:33.103558+00:00", "text": "So since my account has gotten larger I'm trying to find ways to monitize and promoting other pages is one of rhem"}, {"sender": "data_iceberg", "created_at": "2020-09-07T21:57:07.117917+00:00", "likes": [{"username": "datastuffplus", "date": "2020-09-07T22:04:08.868216+00:00"}], "text": "Hey, thanks for your support, the response has been amazing. Hope you enjoyed the contents as well. Could you explain a bit more on promotions? Do specifically do you mean?"}, {"sender": "datastuffplus", "created_at": "2020-09-07T17:56:09.425508+00:00", "text": "Honestly I did it because you have great content but also I want to get into promotions and need to see how much I can actually help accounts in order to be able to make it worth it for people"}, {"sender": "datastuffplus", "created_at": "2020-09-07T17:55:13.824163+00:00", "text": "Hope you get lots of love!"}, {"sender": "data_iceberg", "created_at": "2020-09-07T17:27:19.139779+00:00", "story_share": "Shared datastuffplus's story", "text": "🔥"}, {"sender": "datastuffplus", "created_at": "2020-09-07T15:50:33.675699+00:00", "mentioned_username": "data_iceberg", "story_share": "Shared datastuffplus's story", "text": null}]}, {"participants": ["k7ragav", "data_iceberg"], "conversation": [{"sender": "k7ragav", "created_at": "2020-09-16T21:16:33.299553+00:00", "text": "No. I used a python package called openCV and then run through a set of algorithms for making different shapes out of it"}, {"sender": "data_iceberg", "created_at": "2020-09-08T12:55:24.330258+00:00", "text": "Cool, did you use bicubic to read the whole movie video?"}, {"sender": "data_iceberg", "created_at": "2020-09-08T12:54:46.471570+00:00", "text": "Figma is definitely easier than photoshop. It is like PowerPoint"}, {"sender": "k7ragav", "created_at": "2020-09-08T12:32:41.410833+00:00", "likes": [{"username": "data_iceberg", "date": "2020-09-08T12:54:52.377824+00:00"}], "text": "I did that using bicubic projections on python 🙂"}, {"sender": "k7ragav", "created_at": "2020-09-08T12:31:59.990281+00:00", "text": "Hi. Thanks for your response. 😊\nI'm also planning to learn plotly. But will check on Figma as well. Do you like it better than Adobe.?"}, {"sender": "data_iceberg", "created_at": "2020-09-08T10:59:21.270455+00:00", "text": "Hi! Thanks for your message and also your praise. I use python plotly for graphs, then figma to decorate, nothing too fancy. What about you? What tool do you use? I like how to condense movie frames, how did you manage to do that?"}, {"sender": "k7ragav", "created_at": "2020-09-08T06:22:34.981730+00:00", "text": "Hi! Good morning! I really like your page with the different visuals! Great work!\nI am also getting into the feed of visualizations and trying to keep learning. I really like how you did your visualizations. Do you mind sharing with me the tool that you had used for these visualizations? I am always looking for new plotting tools to practice and learn :)"}]}, {"participants": ["branislavcordic", "data_iceberg"], "conversation": [{"sender": "branislavcordic", "created_at": "2020-09-12T22:02:30.814408+00:00", "text": "Thank you for taking it into consideration, and for responding as well."}, {"sender": "data_iceberg", "created_at": "2020-09-12T19:05:23.881319+00:00", "text": "Also thanks for the message 😉"}, {"sender": "data_iceberg", "created_at": "2020-09-12T19:04:44.185751+00:00", "text": "Hey! Sure, we will look into it. It will take a while, but we’re on it!"}, {"sender": "branislavcordic", "created_at": "2020-09-12T18:16:14.229055+00:00", "text": "Could you consider doing Sopranos episodes ratings graph ? Like the one you did with Breaking Bad"}]}, {"participants": ["vizzlo", "data_iceberg"], "conversation": [{"sender": "vizzlo", "created_at": "2020-09-05T06:28:39.929303+00:00", "text": "Drop me a mail at rob@vizzlo.com if you’d like to give Vizzlo Pro a try — might making visuals a bit easier. The pro version includes vector export. Not trying to sell you something, just would love to hear your feedback."}, {"sender": "vizzlo", "created_at": "2020-09-05T06:25:33.961229+00:00", "text": "Cool, we use Figma for lots of other things, too. Never thought about using it for infographics, though."}, {"sender": "data_iceberg", "created_at": "2020-08-27T12:26:42.925907+00:00", "likes": [{"username": "vizzlo", "date": "2020-09-05T06:23:47.361433+00:00"}], "text": "Hey thanks! And thank for following. I use Python plotly. Also do the graphics using Figma, a storyboard tool for graphic design. It is very to use and free, try it!"}, {"sender": "vizzlo", "created_at": "2020-08-27T12:16:38.021062+00:00", "text": "Hey Data Iceberg! These are some very nice visuals, you create! What tools do you use for the job?"}]}, {"participants": ["similarwebinsights", "data_iceberg"], "conversation": [{"sender": "data_iceberg", "created_at": "2020-08-28T14:04:34.669159+00:00", "likes": [{"username": "similarwebinsights", "date": "2020-08-28T17:42:44.420717+00:00"}], "story_share": "Shared similarwebinsights's story", "text": "💯"}, {"sender": "similarwebinsights", "created_at": "2020-08-28T12:56:49.793815+00:00", "mentioned_username": "data_iceberg", "story_share": "Shared similarwebinsights's story", "text": null}]}, {"participants": ["render_analytics", "data_iceberg"], "conversation": [{"sender": "render_analytics", "created_at": "2020-08-25T14:54:04.417542+00:00", "text": "You guys have some great content- if you would ever be interested in sharing each other’s posts in our own stories or some other form of collaboration to boost each other’s exposure, just let us know!"}]}]